### Variables (identifiants par défaut de docker-compose.yml)
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@railBridge = http://localhost:8082
@airBridge = http://localhost:8083
@booking = http://localhost:8086
@jaeger = http://localhost:16686
@auth = Basic ZGVtbzpkZW1vLXBhc3M=

### 1. Santé & état des circuit breakers (sans auth)
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{railBridge}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{airBridge}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{booking}}/actuator/health

### 2. Recherche multimodale agrégée (TRAIN CORBA + CAR REST)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search?origin=Casablanca&destination=Rabat&date=2026-11-15
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 3. Réservation multimodale nominale 3 modes (TRAIN + AIR + CAR) -> CONFIRMED
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-nominal-01

{
  "segments": [
    {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
    {"mode":"AIR","offerId":"AIR:AIR-RBA-ORY-1200","origin":"Rabat","destination":"Paris","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
    {"mode":"CAR","offerId":"CAR:CAR-CAS-RAB-1000","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1}
  ]
}

### 4. Rejeu idempotent (même Idempotency-Key, même payload -> même bookingId)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-nominal-01

{
  "segments": [
    {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
    {"mode":"AIR","offerId":"AIR:AIR-RBA-ORY-1200","origin":"Rabat","destination":"Paris","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
    {"mode":"CAR","offerId":"CAR:CAR-CAS-RAB-1000","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1}
  ]
}

### 5. Conflit d'idempotence (même clé, payload différent -> HTTP 409)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-nominal-01

{
  "segments": [
    {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":2}
  ]
}

### 6. Scénario d'échec compensé (TRAIN + CAR + vol AIR-CMN-MAD-1800 x 4 > 3 places) -> CANCELLED
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-compensated-01

{
  "segments": [
    {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
    {"mode":"CAR","offerId":"CAR:CAR-CAS-RAB-1000","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
    {"mode":"AIR","offerId":"AIR:AIR-CMN-MAD-1800","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Madrid","date":"2026-11-15","seats":4}
  ]
}

### 7. Vérifier les services enregistrés dans Jaeger
GET {{jaeger}}/api/services

### 8. Lister les dernières traces de réservation dans Jaeger
GET {{jaeger}}/api/traces?service=api-gateway&operation=POST%20/api/v1/bookings&limit=5
